      "writtenOn": "2023-03-05T02:04:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks. Since I couldn\u0027t understand the errors, I tried this by changing MinApiForArch so that it returns PlatformSdkVersion for X86_64 and running the X86_64 build. (I did `m nothing --skip-soong-tests`, but it certainly has passed the checks you were blocked on). The result was a success. So I guess it\u0027s something to do with the RISC-V architecture somewhere else in the build system?\n\nreturning PlatformSdkCodename (filtered through ApiLevelFromUser) gives the same error you reported, and I think it\u0027s causing problem for the modules having `sdk_version: \"minimum\"`, where it uses the value returned from MinApiForArch. Obviously, since UDC is an unreleased version (doesn\u0027t have an int value), it\u0027s an error. I think it will be fixed when UDC gets released or this is built on a release branch.",
