      "message": "Reproduced the same state, works on X86, doesn\u0027t work on RISCV. I\u0027ll try to figure out what\u0027s special about the set of libraries that are upset with this configuration. At a glance, it looks like all cc_library_static binaries are failing. Interesting setting \u0027sdk_version \u003d \"current\"\u0027 fixes the problem for some of the failing libraries.",
