      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the feedback Colin - I\u0027ll look to you Jiyong to make the call. The second suggestion to make a \u0027minVndkForArch\u0027 also works for me, as it also achieves the same effect of undoing the UDC/current conversion.",
