      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-16T02:20:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I prefer the simpler approach of enforcing that we have at least one VNDK APEX. I think the comment doesn\u0027t have to be about subtle semantic difference between UpsideDownCake and current. No VNDK simply doesn\u0027t make sense.\n\n--------------------------\n\u003e we don\u0027t have to go through all of this again if we add another new architecture.\n\nWhat arch will we be adding in the future before Bazel takes over Soong?",
      "parentUuid": "caac4c33_4380fd55",
      "revId": "9f50668d13501f5873fc1c7f5f17ab5ea0f90ef1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
