      "writtenOn": "2023-03-16T04:10:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How do you know which VNDK APEX to keep?  The apexes are iterated individually by this mutator, so you have to know which is the latest.\n\nMaybe a simpler fix is to just never disable `vndkVersion \u003d\u003d mctx.DeviceConfig().PlatformVndkVersion()`.",
      "parentUuid": "ac3e9502_e809dd1c",
      "revId": "9f50668d13501f5873fc1c7f5f17ab5ea0f90ef1",
